     Personally, I feel that the number of wishes found in PL7 is great.  If
wishes became more commonplace, the game becomes a lot less fun.  Even a
wish every other game is almost excessive...
  
     Imaging how often the average fool who would be going down into these
dungeons should encounter wish spells.  Wish is *very* powerful (Stormbringer,
3 blessed potions of gain level, or whatever...), and an average Joe
Adventurer shouldn't find any except for once in a blue moon (NO, not literally
a blue moon, or we only get to play once every 28 days! ;-) )

     Possibly if there could be an option in the beginning, after you type in
your name: "Would you like to enter a (H)ard or an (E)asy dungeon?"  This
would let those who want multiple wishes and (possibly) fewer monsters to
get one high score chart, and the adventurers who are sick of every character
being a Rambo to have another.  Might be difficult to implement (the flag 
would need to be inserted into so MANY routines), but...?


